    "title": {
      "en": "Fuketsu's \u001c Speck of Dust\u001d"
    },
    "text": {
      "en": "Fuketsu, giving instruction, said, �If one raises a speck of dust, the house and the nation prosper.  If one does not raise a speck of dust, they perish.�\nSetch� held up his staff and said, �Is there anyone who lives and dies with this?�\n\nA white-headed man rises from his angling by the Isui River;\nThe two brothers on Mt. Shuy� are starved for their purity:  \nWhich is what?\nIt is a speck of dust, with different transformations;\nFame and accomplishment:  neither will perish easily."
    },
