    "text": {
      "en": "Even if you call it �thus,� it has already changed.\nWhere knowledge cannot reach, you should abandon talking about it.\nHere, is it possible to search for it or not?\n\nZuigan asked Gant�, �What is the everlasting truth?�  Gant� said, �It has moved.�  Zuigan said, �What if it moves?�  Gant� said, �You can't see the everlasting truth.�  Zuigan thought for a moment.  Gant� said, �If you acknowledge it, you are not yet free from the roots and their dust.  If you do not acknowledge it, you are immersed in endless birth and death.�\n\nThe round jewel has no holes,\nThe great raw gem needs no polishing.\nWhat a person of the Way cherishes has no edges.\nWhen the road of acknowledgement is abolished, the roots and their dust are emptied out:\nA complete exposure, relying on nothing � so active, so unique."
